---
// HTML counterpart of the shared Strands flowchart style.
---

<figure id="shipment-policy" class="dg-figure shipment-policy" data-diagram="box-shipment-policy" role="img" aria-labelledby="diagram-title" aria-describedby="diagram-description">
  <p class="diagram-title" id="diagram-title">How Box checks a shipment request</p>
  <p class="scope">Both checks use recorded responses for the same order within the last five minutes.</p>
  <figcaption id="diagram-description" class="sr-only">
    An agent requests a shipment. If the order service has not confirmed eligibility
    for this order in the last five minutes, Box blocks the request. If eligibility
    was confirmed, Box checks whether the service has also confirmed a shipment
    for this order in that period. If so, Box blocks the request. Otherwise, Box
    forwards the request to the order service. The allowed path goes straight down.
    Both blocked paths branch to the right.
  </figcaption>

  <div class="flow" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="node request"><span class="node-name">Shipment request</span></div>
    <div class="edge edge-down to-eligibility"></div>

    <div class="node decision eligibility">
      <span class="node-name">Eligibility<br>confirmed?</span>
    </div>
    <div class="edge edge-right to-blocked-first"><span class="edge-label">NO</span></div>
    <div class="node blocked-first"><span class="node-name">Request blocked</span></div>
    <div class="edge edge-down to-shipped"><span class="edge-label">YES</span></div>

    <div class="node decision shipped">
      <span class="node-name">Shipment<br>confirmed?</span>
    </div>
    <div class="edge edge-right to-blocked-second"><span class="edge-label">YES</span></div>
    <div class="node blocked-second"><span class="node-name">Request blocked</span></div>
    <div class="edge edge-down to-allowed"><span class="edge-label">NO</span></div>

    <div class="node allowed">
      <span class="node-name">Forward request</span>
      <span class="node-detail">To the order service</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .shipment-policy {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 24px 16px;
  }

  .shipment-policy .diagram-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .shipment-policy .scope {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 8px 0 28px;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .shipment-policy .flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 264px) minmax(40px, 96px) minmax(0, 176px);
    grid-template-rows: 48px 40px 96px 48px 96px 48px 64px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .shipment-policy .node {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    justify-self: center;
    width: 100%;
    height: 56px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--dg-paper);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .shipment-policy .node-name {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--dg-ink);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .shipment-policy .request {
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
    width: min(100%, 192px);
    height: 48px;
    border-color: var(--dg-muted);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: var(--dg-input-fill);
  }

  .shipment-policy .decision {
    height: 96px;
    padding: 0 22%;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: none;
  }

  .shipment-policy .decision::before,
  .shipment-policy .decision::after {
    position: absolute;
    content: "";
    clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0 50%);
  }

  .shipment-policy .decision::before {
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--dg-line);
  }

  .shipment-policy .decision::after {
    inset: 1.2px 2px;
    background: var(--dg-paper);
  }

  .shipment-policy .eligibility { grid-area: 3 / 1; }
  .shipment-policy .shipped { grid-area: 5 / 1; }
  .shipment-policy .blocked-first { grid-area: 3 / 3; }
  .shipment-policy .blocked-second { grid-area: 5 / 3; }

  .shipment-policy .allowed {
    grid-area: 7 / 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    width: min(100%, 224px);
    height: 64px;
    border-color: var(--dg-accent);
    border-radius: 32px;
    background: var(--dg-accent-tint);
  }

  .shipment-policy .allowed .node-name { color: var(--dg-accent); }
  .shipment-policy .node-detail {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge::before,
  .shipment-policy .edge::after {
    position: absolute;
    content: "";
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge-down::before {
    top: 0;
    bottom: 7px;
    left: calc(50% - 0.625px);
    border-left: 1.25px solid currentColor;
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge-down::after {
    bottom: 2px;
    left: calc(50% - 3px);
    border-top: 7px solid currentColor;
    border-right: 3px solid transparent;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge-right::before {
    top: calc(50% - 0.625px);
    right: 7px;
    left: 0;
    border-top: 1.25px solid currentColor;
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge-right::after {
    top: calc(50% - 3px);
    right: 2px;
    border-top: 3px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
    border-left: 7px solid currentColor;
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge-label {
    position: absolute;
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge-down .edge-label {
    top: calc(50% - 6px);
    left: calc(50% + 10px);
  }

  .shipment-policy .edge-right .edge-label {
    top: calc(50% - 22px);
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .shipment-policy .to-eligibility { grid-area: 2 / 1; }
  .shipment-policy .to-shipped { grid-area: 4 / 1; color: var(--dg-accent); }
  .shipment-policy .to-allowed { grid-area: 6 / 1; color: var(--dg-accent); }
  .shipment-policy .to-blocked-first { grid-area: 3 / 2; }
  .shipment-policy .to-blocked-second { grid-area: 5 / 2; }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .shipment-policy { padding: 20px 12px; }
    .shipment-policy .flow {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) 40px minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .shipment-policy .node { padding-inline: 6px; }
    .shipment-policy .decision { padding-inline: 16%; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 380px) {
    .shipment-policy { padding-inline: 0; }
    .shipment-policy .flow {
      grid-template-rows: 64px 40px 96px 48px 96px 48px 96px;
    }
    .shipment-policy .request { height: 64px; }
    .shipment-policy .allowed { height: 96px; }
  }
</style>
